OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 17, dies in crash and three
OL,4,Aothers badly hurt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old girl has died and three
OL,7,Fothers seriously injured in a crash
OL,8,Fbetween two cars.
OL,10,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said
OL,11,Fthe collision happened at about 16:00
OL,12,FGMT on Thursday in Lower Seedley Road,
OL,13,FSalford.
OL,15,FA force spokesperson said the teenager,
OL,16,Fwho died in hospital after the crash,
OL,17,Fhad been a passenger in a car modified
OL,18,Ffor people with additional needs.
OL,20,FGMP has appealed for witnesses to come
OL,21,Fforward and asked for any mobile phone,
OL,22,Fdashcam or CCTV footage.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
